ani Enterprises (+13.3%), Axis Bank (+12.8%), Tata Motors PV (+11.7%), Bajaj Auto (+11.1%), Bajaj Finance (+11.2%), Eicher Motors (+10.5%), and Trent (+10%) led the rally.","url":"https://www.cnbctv18.com/photos/market/nifty-50-rally-this-week-best-performers-trent-bajaj-shriram-finance-auto-axis-bank-tata-motors-pv-share-price-ws-e-19884737.htm","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-04-10T15:09:17","source":"CNBC TV 18"},{"id":"566899","title":"HDFC Bank ranks third among private lenders in large defaulter exposure, with dues of Rs 54,315 crore as of Feb 2026.\nHDFC Bank's cautious lending keeps its exposure lower than ICICI Bank's Rs 2.78 lakh crore and Axis Bank's Rs 66,338 crore.","summary":"HDFC Bank ranks third among private lenders in large defaulter exposure, with dues of Rs 54,315 crore as of Feb 2026.\nHDFC Bank's cautious lending keeps its exposure lower than ICICI Bank's Rs 2.78 lakh crore and Axis Bank's Rs 66,338 crore.","url":"https://www.news18.com/business/banking-finance/hdfc-bank-third-in-large-defaulter-exposure-among-private-lenders-report-ws-l-10023684.html","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-04-09T12:42:26","source":"News 18"},{"id":"566358","title":"Nomura sees limited upside for PSU banks, prefers private banks like Axis Bank, ICICI Bank, and Kotak Mahindra Bank due to favorable valuations.\nPSU banks' rally driven by cyclical factors; private banks offer stronger earnings visibility, trading below historical valuation levels.","summary":"Nomura sees limited upside for PSU banks, prefers private banks like Axis Bank, ICICI Bank, and Kotak Mahindra Bank due to favorable valuations.\nPSU banks' rally driven by cyclical factors; private banks offer stronger earnings visibility, trading below historical valuation levels.","url":"https://www.business-standard.com/markets/news/nomura-flags-4-risks-for-psu-bank-stocks-prefers-axis-bank-icici-bank-126040900253_1.html","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-04-09T09:52:32","source":"Business Standard"},{"id":"260409